# Frame_Panel - the HUD / menu window: a round gold moulding, a navy bevelled band, a thin inner gold fillet and
# a recessed, flat navy field (HUD text sits on it, so the centre carries no texture).
# 36x36, Tiled, border 10 on every side: rows / columns 0..9 are the frame, 10..25 the centre tile.
# Light from the top-left: the moulding is a half-round bar (lit face up-left, dark face down-right), the band is a
# mitred bevel (top/left faces lit, bottom/right in shade) and the frame casts a 1 px shadow into the field on the
# top and left. The four corner bosses are painted with the same light (not mirrored).
size 36 36
key
  K #0a0c18  ink (outer line)
  H #fff4b8  gold highlight (lit face of the moulding)
  L #ffd65a  gold light (lit face on the shade sides)
  G #e8a830  gold (moulding base, inner fillet)
  D #a8661a  gold shade
  X #5c360c  gold deep line (sel-out between gold and navy)
  B #283867  navy band, lit faces
  N #1f2c56  navy band, shade faces
  C #172246  navy field
  E #111936  groove / cast shadow
strokes
  # outer silhouette: straight sides, a clean 45 degree chamfer of 3 at every corner
  line K 3 0 32 0 35 3 35 32 32 35 3 35 0 32 0 3 3 0
  # inner edge of the moulding
  rect X 3 3 32 32
  # groove, then the inner gold fillet (square corners so the centre tile stays clean)
  rect E 7 7 28 28
  rect G 8 8 27 27
seeds
  G 12 1
  B 12 5
  C 18 18
ops
  # the moulding: the face that looks up and the face that looks left catch the light
  band G H 0 -1 1
  band G H -1 0 1
  # mitre: everything on the bottom-right of the anti-diagonal is on the shade side
  poly =H L 36 0 36 36 0 36
  poly =G D 36 0 36 36 0 36
  poly =B N 36 0 36 36 0 36
  # the frame casts a 1 px shadow into the recessed field (top and left only)
  band C E 0 -1 1
  band C E -1 0 1
# corner blocks: where the band's sides meet, a square gold block (like the corner block of a picture frame),
# bevelled with the same top-left light in all four corners (never mirrored)
shade at 4 4
  HHL
  HLD
  LDD
shade at 29 4
  HHL
  HLD
  LDD
shade at 4 29
  HHL
  HLD
  LDD
shade at 29 29
  HHL
  HLD
  LDD
